id: pm-bbyopg
title: Preserve MCP warning enforcement when late console logs lack module attribution
description: Full validation exposed a TypeError in McpContractReporter.onUserConsoleLog when a reported entity has no module after a timed-out compatibility test. Console attribution may disappear while logs are still delivered. Handle the absent module while continuing to reject undeclared MCP warnings under unknown attribution; preserve the original timeout and warning allowlist.
