  "2026-10-12T18:11:59.782Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live corpus and fresh MCP/reporter/module/console search plus open/in_progress inventories found existing conformance ownership but no exact active owner for this observed reporter crash. The full-run stack names onUserConsoleLog relativeModuleId. This is a verification defect discovered during the connected SDK delivery."
  "2026-10-12T18:22:51.015Z","harness:codex","Independent negative control fails before the single optional-module guard. Late ordinary logs remain ordinary, while an unattributed undeclared MCP option still fails onTestRunEnd under the unknown file and original warning identity. Keep the exact allowlist, retry enforcement, original compatibility timeout and source coverage thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-10-12T18:28:04.660Z","harness:codex","Verification: the original absent-module control fails with relativeModuleId TypeError. After the one-character optional-module guard, all three reporter tests pass, including a real otherwise-green Vitest process that still fails for undeclared MCP drift. The original published-artifact matrix also passes both cases and all four writer/reader directions in 88.9 seconds under its unchanged 180-second limit. All linked PM tests pass; the corrected reporter preserves warning enforcement rather than discarding unknown-attribution logs."
